      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya sea sibanga Baali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ning'ata eawoojiga saang'a ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Eliya, aba gweaydeaba samwagu, ak gwayeesha, “Una ahiimsiina geaw Ahabu; ak gaydeajeagu roopta jeeda ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Eliya ghoahiimda geaw aba heeda Ahabu. Nea abeeda ea haw geejeeda aba ng'eanyiida Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguursa Ahabu Obadiyayda was siida miineadaysa gheanyi. (Nea Obadiya gwasissa mureeda muuchi NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yesebeli ea nihuuyda sibanga NG'UTAMIIDA, gageanu Obadiya siban bughala ak ghafuy nea ghwanung' gabadiina haradam ea damanamughuush aba jeeda gwaleeda, ak ghoadaw mukaate ea beega.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Ahabu Obadiya, “Una jeeda ng'eanyiida sean ea jeeda gheanyanga eeniga ea moangoachihajeega sean; gwadeepa eanyasa nyeega ak geaweachi faraasajeega ea nghadiga, adiidu goosha haleanjeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwalakiisa geat ng'eanyiida jea ghwala jeeda; Ahabu ghwala meatkweenagi nea gaba geaw, ak Obadiya ghwala meatkweeda niirja nea gaba geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gwanda Obadiya jeeda naweeda, ging'ulayi Eliya gwaroonyi sea niny; ak ghwanal Obadiya niny, ak gwahiiysa geaw madeadaanyi, ak gwayeesha, “Siida ang'iing'i siideanyu haw was Eliya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha niny, “Aniini gil. Una, rukusiina siidaang'u haw, ‘Ng'ula Eliya gwanda hiji.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Aniini neadiinyi naaha, bwak ea gasa iina siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda geatinga Ahabu, gwanuusan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gidamideata NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, manda eemeeda ghana sugoocheanduumeeda miigoojeagu siideanyu haw gagaseey. Ak gwayi, ‘Manda hiji,’ gayghwaak habeawooda sugoocheanduumeeda, ghana dea eemeeda gideaba miighwadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa giyeeni, ‘Una rukusiina ng'utamiidaang'u, “Ng'ula Eliya gwanda hiji.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa iyaang'ami headaang'u, guroorooda NG'UTAMIIDA gaygoogealnyi heeda mwaanali; ak inyas geawi heeda Ahabu ak ea mwanyasa heeda indi abeeda gaygwanuusan, nea aniineeda was siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda geawalayi gheang'da NG'UTAMIIDA gidang'eada jeepcheanduumeedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miyeerukusa siideanyu haw gideasinyi damanda nuus Yesebeli sibanga NG'UTAMIIDA, gida aafuydi fih bughala bea sibanga NG'UTAMIIDA nea gweata haradam ea damanamughuush aba jeeda gwaleadinga, ak ghaang'aataawi mukaate ea beega? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa giyeeni, ‘Una rukusiina siidaang'u haw, “Ng'ula Eliya gwanda hiji”’; ak abeeda gaygwanuusan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Eliya, “Gidamideata NG'UTAMIIDA mideawa uurda, eamiinaadawi madeadaanyi, ean gaydeahiimsa geaw askweareani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Obadiya gwaroonyi Ahabu; ak gwayeesha; ak gawa Ahabu gwaroonyi sea Eliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah Ahabu Eliya, gwayeesha Ahabu, “Nea ang'iing'i ea muwoosi siida ayuuk fuga Israeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Aniini miideaneayi fuga Israeli, giineayi ang'iing'i ea ghaheang'wa, aba gideaba naanung'waadi digheanyeeka NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghoayaachi geeshta Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa ajeakta buuneeda ghabwada geat fuga sean bea Israeli aba geeta giijeeda Garmeli, ea fih bughalaji ang'wan ea haradam ea damanamughuush was sibanga Baali ea bughalaji ang'wan was sibanga Ashera,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gheawunga aseeta was gatmooda bea fuga Ganaani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " agiisacheewa badayda measeeda Yesebeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeaksa Ahabu buuneesean bea Israeli, ak ghoamughuush sibanga aba hijagi aba geeshta giijeeda Garmeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaneekiisa Eliya heeda mida buuneesean ak gwayi, “Gajabeacheewana jeedeaba ng'asheesu asiyeenyean ea ghoah eeju? Inyas NG'UTAMIIDA ea ASEETA gil, ghoayaachi geeshta, ama inyas ea Baali gil, eara ada ghoayaachi geeshta.” Ak ea mwasha buuneeda ghuutaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Eliya buuneeda, “Siipuudan aniini was sibaneeda NG'UTAMIIDA; nea sibanga Baali hita bughalaji ang'wan ea haradam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nung' eegooneasa heew iyeenya, ak gageanda heawagi ak ghwalajaada ak gawiilsa badayda ghweenga nea adiidu ghoaghwardi aba beasta ak gaydasisin heeyda niirja ak geawiilsi badayda ghweenga nea maydaghwarda aba beasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goomusiischi aba gheawunga aseeteang'wa ak eara aniini gaydamusiischi aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA; aba ASEETA jea ghwasha ghuusigaasa aba beasta gayghoah ASEETA.” Hean gwayi buuneesean, “Ng'asheesu ghwadoabiiw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Eliya sibanga Baali, “Aloosiina geat heawagi ak goosheedi agooga asisina; aba gideaba goowooschi saang'a, ak ghoamwaashchi gheawunga aseeteang'wa nea adiidu ghoaghwardi aba beasta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu heeyda siitaw saawa, hean gwasisin, ak ghamwaash gheawunga Baali ghang'eada sakteayda ea ghoah askweari, nea gwayeena, “Ea Baali shaaha ghuusigaasa!” Ea manda gil nyeara, nea manda siisi nyaah ghuuta. Hean ghang'was aba heeda wagiida sin saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu askweari ghabwara Eliya budeay saawa, nea gwayeesha, “Aguursiina aba uurda, aba gideaba niny aseeta; gwadeepa gwanda jeeda baloolda, ghana gwadeepa gagadiiy ghana ea nuwa bareanyeeka, ghana gwadeepa gwalil ak gagasa heedita.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean googuul aba uurda, ak ghwalajaada geat aba ng'utkeaka ea janawajeega aba seareeda gheanyaawa, bwak ea gwayiiliida saseenuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ning'ata askwearjeanda gwaramoorani bwak ea ghwahita damanda siitayiideawa haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda ak ea manda gil nyeara; nea manda siisi nyaah ghuuta ghana gang'ulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Eliya buuneesean, “Apkaani aneekiida,” ak ghapka buuneeda heeda mida niny. Ak ghwadeas gicha heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA nea abeeda ghayi ea ninyar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageanu Eliya laghean damaniyeenya, sigala dooshinga orjooga Yakobo, hisiina ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha, “Gheawungaagu gajeeguura Israeli”; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak lagheangiga ghwadeasa heeda wagiida aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak gwasin mapariida aba heeda wagiida, nea hawundaanyi gwadeena gil sigala geenga booga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwajip ghweenga, ak ghwalajaada banyeega heeyda ak ghwayiin badayda ghweenga. Ak gwayeesha, “Oanyiida beega sirbaji ang'wan, ak goohiisi badayda lukghumajeega jea eaghwarda, ea badayda ghweenga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Abiikta deaba iyeenya”; ak gwasindunu niba iyeenya, ak gwayeesha gicha, “Asina niba samwagu”; ak gwasindunu niba samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweayeesa beega heeda wagiida, ea ghoanyiit mapariida beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda siitayiideawa haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweedean shing'ada, gwaneekiit sibaneeda was Eliya ak gwayi, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Abrahamu, ea Isaka, ea Israeli, nung' eejeeng'u askweareani gideaba guwoosi ASEETA Israeli, ea gideaba geawooschi siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda, ea gideaba geasinyi ng'asheesu aba ng'asheandaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinya ghuuteanyu, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, shaaha ghuuteanyu ak ginung' ghwanal fiisu gideaba ang'iing'i NG'UTAMIIDA, guwoosi ASEETA, nea ea niyami gurooruunatka nyaawa gabiikseey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahiing'aan beasta NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwaak haleanjeeda sisabwa geat sigwariida, ea ghweenga, ea lagheanga, ea birjeanda, ak ghameash beega sean mida jeeda mapariida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah buuneeda, gwahiing'sa geat ng'eanyi; ak gwayi, “NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETA gil, NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETA gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Eliya saawa, “Oang'waanya sibanga Baali, adiidu ghaghu eara siyagi.” Hean ghoang'waay; ak ghwaat Eliya jeeda eenda Gidroni, ak gwanuuseada aba hoowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muudeanooda geejeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Eliya Ahabu, “Ng'eada, agiischeena ak gileeshi; aba gideaba gwanda daghata roopta haw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'eat Ahabu ak gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi nea gawa Eliya uhuuda Garmeli; ak gwahiing'sa geaw ng'eanyi, ea ghwahita gheamamdaanyi gutung'weakaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda, “Heapi diyeada, ak giing'weersi murdeeda basooda.” Hean gwadiyeada ak ghoang'wearda, ak gwayeesha, “Manda gil.” Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Una niba ispwa”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hita deaba ispwa gwayi, “Ng'ula, shamooghooni mwanang' deena baneakta siida nea gwarina jeeda basooda.” Ak gwayeesha, “Ng'eada una, ak giyeeshi Ahabu, ‘Ng'aaba mutukoadaang'u adiidu ghoadealnyi roopta.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea miighoah gil, gwatuudu humng'eeda aba shamooghuutka ea jeameeda, ak ghwaroabwan roopta haw. Hean ghamwanmwan Ahabu mutukoadaanyi ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Yesneli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea geatinda NG'UTAMIIDA gwanda badayda Eliya; hean ghwarat manandaanyi ak ghafwach goosheedeawa Ahabu ea ghwahita gidaghuuta Yesneli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
